,{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Supply distinct lifetime and work partitions. Their limits add to the participating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"memory allowance. CPU\/GPU peers may share "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"workBudget"},{"type":"text","text":". Never acquire lifetime"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"capacity while holding workspace, or acquire workspace again inside run callbacks."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Idle lifetime capacity is unavailable to work; reservations do not cap process RSS."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The lifetime charge includes pool slots and source\/consumer context. Each run holds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its entire window until callbacks and predictions finish. Bound each source to choose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"how often workspace is yielded. No automatic chunk size or scheduling policy is chosen."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Await structured child tasks inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"operation"},{"type":"text","text":". Exit rejects new runs, drains an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"active run, closes the pool, and releases its lifetime charge. Callbacks must cooperate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with cancellation. Escaped session references reject runs after this scope closes."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Retains a model while successive runs acquire and release a separate work budget."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftml\/coremlbatchpipeline\/withsession(compiledmodelurl:inputcolumns:outputname:computeunits:preprocessing:lifetimebudget:workbudget:configuration:operation:)"]}],"metadata":{"roleHea